  ['<code>ALARM_TRACK_RMID</code>']: '<code>ALARM_TRACK_RMID</code>',
  ['3.05']: '3.05',
  ['Annulus 2.85..3.25. Its inner edge overlaps the hub\'s wall (2.8667) by 0.0167: one piece of the disc, so a joint, not a fit. The pin rides outside the wall (its inner edge 2.91), and the annulus lies inside the rim\'s root circle (4.3812).']: 'Anwlws 2.85..3.25. Mae ei fin mewnol yn gorgyffwrdd â wal y foth (2.8667) o 0.0167: un darn o\'r disg, felly uniad, nid ffitiad. Mae\'r pin yn rhedeg y tu allan i\'r wal (ei fin mewnol 2.91), ac mae\'r anwlws o fewn cylch gwraidd y cylchyn (4.3812).',
